%% Nested-subproject fixture — root self.glp.
%%
%% PURPOSE: sole coverage of the project linker's nested-subproject entry-alias
%% rule (project-compilation spec §3.4). The parent project (this directory)
%% contains a root-level module (boot) and a nested sub-project (child/) that has
%% its OWN self.glp. When the parent is the loaded root, only root-level exports
%% are aliased; the nested module keeps prefixed names only. When child/ is the
%% loaded root, its own exports are aliased. No production project exercises both
%% halves of this rule in one tree — hence this minimal dedicated fixture.
